["Type 3: A→aB | a (right-linear); accepted by finite automata.","Type 2: A→γ (single variable on left); accepted by pushdown automata.","Type 1: α→β with |α| ≤ |β|; accepted by linear bounded automata.","Type 0: α→β any (α≠ε); accepted by Turing machines.","Regular ⊂ CFL ⊂ CSL ⊂ Recursive ⊂ RE.","Each inclusion is proper."],
