"A turnstile or vending machine: each coin or button moves it to exactly one next state; it unlocks only in the accepting state.",
"DFA for strings over {0,1} ending in 01: states q0,q1,q2; q0:0→q1,1→q0; q1:0→q1,1→q2; q2:0→q1,1→q0; start q0; final q2. Trace 1101: q0→1→q0→1→q0→0→q1→1→q2 accept.",
