"L1=even number of a's, L2=ends with b. Intersection via product DFA with state pairs. Complement: make the DFA complete and swap accepting and non-accepting states.",
["Closure: ∪, ∩, complement, concatenation, *, reversal, difference, homomorphism, inverse homomorphism.","Complement: complete DFA, flip final states.","Intersection: product construction (p,q); union similarly; or De Morgan.","Reversal: reverse edges, swap start and final (NFA).","Decision: emptiness (reachability), finiteness (cycles), membership (run DFA), equivalence (minimise or symmetric difference empty).","Not closed under infinite union."],
